iv><div class="e2XBBf QR7YS"><div class="kPEoYc GOJTSe"></div></div></div><div class="aopPX fDBOYb EjXFBf"><div class="e2XBBf uEtL3"><div class="kPEoYc GOJTSe"></div></div><div class="LqC3Y"><div class="kPEoYc GOJTSe"></div></div><div class="e2XBBf QR7YS"><div class="kPEoYc GOJTSe"></div></div></div></div></div><c-data id="c106" jsdata=" d29a7;ChkItJn3yLyr7fOxARoML2cvMTFyOTIzMng4EAEaf0FQZGZiVzV0ZWJ2NXMxVlVQTFp3SV9jT0lROEZTSWp0YU1xdW5yRjVpVzdQRlJHVG5EZlBFUXpPRlg3ZENpNS0wUmgydDJzVXJabWNubmdhS1BMSlROaUFnSmhFdFZnaWZfdlVKV1FJUFV6c0x6RFhvU1o5aWdnaC1zTmhsWnc;$82"></c-data></c-wiz><c-data id="c107" jsdata=" IL7MAe;_;$83 ;unsupported;$84"></c-data></c-wiz></span><span jsslot="" class="HALYaf fwfrGd ftRkTe" jsname="PAiuue" role="tabpanel" id="details" data-ved="0CL8FEPTOAmoXChMIyMu7nZf8ggMVAAAAAB0AAAAAEGE" data-hveid="703"><c-wiz jsrenderer="TLXT4c" class="K1smNd" data-is-embedded="true" data-is-generic-tab-panel="true" jsshadow="" jsdata="deferred-c111" data-p="%.@.[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1],[1,null,null,null,null,&quot;CgsItJn3yLyr7fOxARABGn9BUGRmYlc1dGVidjVzMVZVUExad0lfY09JUThGU0lqdGFNcXVuckY1aVc3UEZSR1RuRGZQRVF6T0ZYN2RDaTUtMFJoMnQyc1VyWm1jbm5nYUtQTEpUTmlBZ0poRXRWZ2lmX3ZVSldRSVBVenNMekRYb1NaOWlnZ2gtc05obFp3&quot;,6,[[&quot;7823763060710539980&quot;],[&quot;6002233408902787840&quot;],[&quot;12858129999509061941&quot;]],0]]" jscontroller="LAjRfe" jsname="oPKIxc" data-node-index="3;5" jsmodel="hc6Ubd" c-wiz=""><c-wiz jsrenderer="iXwl5b" jsshadow="" jsdata="deferred-c110" data-p="%.@.0]" data-node-index="1;0" jsmodel="hc6Ubd" c-wiz=""><div class="FbLHzc kh7loe"><div class="mM6NLb"><div jsname="z5Cjge" class="fU5h8b YYZeDd"><div class="BczChc eoY5cb"><section class="mEKuwe G8T82"><h2 class="ZSxxwc g2m8zc">Sobre este hotel</h2><div class="eFfcqe"><div class="U1L8Pd"><div class="D35lie"><span class="d6eqsd" jscontroller="Z1JTXd" jsaction="JIbuQc:GH7jgd(z5C9Gb)"><p class="GtAk2e">Resort all-suites descontraído localizado em uma região comercial. Está situado em meio aos jardins que cercam a Praia do Jurerê. Também fica a 2 km da Fortaleza de São José da Ponta Grossa.<span class="ngca6c">… <button class="VfPpkd-LgbsSe VfPpkd-LgbsSe-OWXEXe-Bz112c-UbuQg VfPpkd-LgbsSe-OWXEXe-dgl2Hf ksBjEc lKxP2d LQeN7 iigpze" jscontroller="soHxf" jsaction="click:cOuCgd; mousedown:UX7yZ; mouseup:lbsD7e; mouseenter:tfO1Yc; mouseleave:JywGue; touchstart:p6p2H; touchmove:FwuNnf; touchend:yfqBxc; touchcancel:JMtRjd; focus:AHmuwe; blur:O22p3e; contextmenu:mg9Pef;mlnRJb:fLiPzd;" data-idom-class="ksBjEc lKxP2d LQeN7 iigpze" jsname="z5C9Gb" aria-label="Ler mais" jslog="45819;ved:0CMAFEPvlAmoXChMIyMu7nZf8ggMVAAAAAB0AAAAAEGE;track:JIbuQc"><div class="VfPpkd-Jh9lGc"></div><div class="VfPpkd-J1Ukfc-LhBDec"></div><div class="VfPpkd-RLmnJb"></div><span jsname="V67aGc" class="VfPpkd-vQzf8d" aria-hidden="true">Mais</span><span class="VfPpkd-kBDsod D70abf" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" class=" NMm5M"><path d="M12 16.41l-6.71-6.7 1.42-1.42 5.29 5.3 5.29-5.3 1.42 1.42z"></path></svg></span></button></span></p><p class="FP7qAb GtAk2e">As suítes elegantes têm minicozinha, sacada e sala de estar com sofá-cama, além de Wi-Fi gratuito, TV com tela plana e chuveiro tipo spa. Alguns oferecem vista para o mar. As suítes de categoria mais alta incluem banheira de hidromassagem. Serviço de quarto 24 horas.</p><p class="FP7qAb GtAk2e">Café da manhã e estacionamento inclusos. O hotel conta com vários restaurantes: um italiano, um à beira da piscina e um bar no lobby. Outras comodidades incluem spa, cinco piscinas cobertas e externas, sendo duas delas infantis, e academia, além de sala de jogos, espaço de recreação e lounge com lareira.</p></span></div><div class="D35lie"><div class="b9tWsd">Horário de check-in: <span class="IIl29e">15:00</span></div><div class="b9tWsd">Horário de check-out: <span class="IIl29e">11:00</span></div></div></div><div class="U1L8Pd"><div><h3 class="E4fRnd YMlIz">Dados de contato e endereço</h3><div class="G8T82"><div class="GtAk2e"><span class="XGa8fd" aria-label="endereço do hotel: Av. dos Búzios, 1760 - Jurerê Internacional, Florianópolis - SC, 88053-301"><span class="Ic9uSb" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" class=" NMm5M"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zM7 9c0-2.76 2.24-5 5-5s5 2.24 5 5c0 2.88-2.88 7.19-5 9.88C9.92 16.21 7 11.85 7 9z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"></circle></svg></span>Av. dos Búzios, 1760 - Jurerê Internacional, Florianópolis - SC, 88053-301</span></div><div class="GtAk2e"><span class="XGa8fd" aria-label="ligue para este hotel: (48) 3331-7200"><span class="Ic9uSb" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" class=" NMm5M"><path d="M16.01 14.46l-2.62 2.62a16.141 16.141 0 0 1-6.5-6.5l2.62-2.62a.98.98 0 0 0 .27-.9L9.13 3.8c-.09-.46-.5-.8-.98-.8H4c-.56 0-1.03.47-1 1.03a17.92 17.92 0 0 0 2.43 8.01 18.08 18.08 0 0 0 6.5 6.5 17.92 17.92 0 0 0 8.01 2.43c.56.03 1.03-.44 1.03-1v-4.15c0-.48-.34-.89-.8-.98l-3.26-.65a.99.99 0 0 0-.9.27z"></path></svg></span><span dir="ltr">(48) 3331-7200</span></span></div></div><div class="G8T82"><div class="hjCdqc"><div class="VfPpkd-dgl2Hf-ppHlrf-sM5MNb" data-is-touch-wrapper="true"><div class="VfPpkd-LgbsSe VfPpkd-LgbsSe-OWXEXe-INsAgc VfPpkd-LgbsSe-OWXEXe-Bz112c-M1Soyc VfPpkd-LgbsSe-OWXEXe-dgl2Hf Rj2Mlf OLiIxf PDpWxe LQeN7 my6Xrf PdgMif wJjnG dA7Fcf TGBlJc" jscontroller="nKuFpb" jsaction="click:cOuCgd; mousedown:UX7yZ; mouseup:lbsD7e; mouseenter:tfO1Yc; mouseleave:JywGue; touchstart:p6p2H; touchmove:FwuNnf; touchend:yfqBxc; touchcancel:JMtRjd; focus:AHmuwe; blur:O22p3e; contextmenu:mg9Pef;mlnRJb:fLiPzd;" data-idom-class="Rj2Mlf OLiIxf PDpWxe LQeN7 my6Xrf PdgMif wJjnG dA7Fcf TGBlJc"><div class="VfPpkd-Jh9lGc"></div><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" class="zKmjoe NMm5M"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 1